summary:
  A person's Live from a relayed park raises the order although nothing plays.

history:
  The relay's UP refuses to play over a park, so the order stood with no
  sound and the network's return put the station on by itself.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
          if (timeshift.shifted && !root._tsPaused && root._previewUrl === "") _orderGiven();

replace:
          if (timeshift.shifted || !root._tsPaused || root._previewUrl === "") _orderGiven();

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_a_person_giving_the_order_dates_it_afresh.
  Line-neutral.
